@prefix ldh:    <https://w3id.org/atomgraph/linkeddatahub#> .
@prefix rdf:    <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix dh:     <https://www.w3.org/ns/ldt/document-hierarchy#> .
@prefix dct:    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<> a dh:Item ;
    dct:title "Create documents" ;
    dct:description "Learn how to create container and item documents" ;
    rdf:_1 <#content> .

<#content> a ldh:XHTML ;
    rdf:value """<div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
    <p class="lead">Learn how to create container and item documents</p>
    <div>
        <h2 id="create-container">Create a container</h2>
        <p>To create a container document (which can have <a href="../../../reference/data-model/documents/#hierarchy" target="_blank">child documents</a>) with a custom URL, follow these steps:</p>
        <div class="ldhc-tabs or-horizontal">
            <div class="ldhc-tablist sz-md va-line" role="tablist">
                <button aria-controls="user-interface-pane" aria-selected="true" class="ldhc-tab is-on" id="user-interface-tab" role="tab" type="button"><span class="ldhc-tab-lbl">User interface</span></button>
                <button aria-controls="command-line-interface-pane" aria-selected="false" class="ldhc-tab" id="command-line-interface-tab" role="tab" type="button"><span class="ldhc-tab-lbl">Command line interface</span></button>
            </div>
            <div aria-labelledby="user-interface-tab" class="ldhc-tabpanel" id="user-interface-pane" role="tabpanel">
                    <div>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Click the <span class="btn btn-primary create-action">Create <span class="caret"></span></span> dropdown in the top-left corner and select <dfn>Container</dfn>. This will open a new form.</li>
                            <li>Fill out the mandatory <dfn>Container</dfn> fields in the form:
                                <dl>
                                    <dt>Title</dt>
                                    <dd>Enter <samp>Categories</samp></dd>
                                </dl>
                            </li>
                            <li>To customize the container URL, click on the dropdown in the top-right corner of the form</li>
                            <li>Replace the generated unique relative URI with <samp>categories</samp></li>
                            <li>Click <span class="btn btn-primary btn-save">Save</span></li>
                        </ol>
                        <div class="screenshot-placeholder">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="msi">play_circle</span>
                            <p>Screen recording: the container creation form</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <div aria-labelledby="command-line-interface-tab" class="ldhc-tabpanel" hidden="hidden" id="command-line-interface-pane" role="tabpanel">
                    <div>
                        <p>With the <a href="../../../reference/command-line-interface/#environment-variables"><samp>LDH_*</samp> environment variables</a> supplying the certificate and base URI, execute the following command:</p>
                        <pre>ldh create-container \\
  --title "Categories" \\
  --slug "categories" \\
  --parent "$LDH_BASE"</pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
        </div>
        <p>A container titled <samp>Categories</samp> should appear with the URI <samp>${LDH_BASE}categories/</samp>.</p>
        <p>Any text works as the URI path segment — characters outside RFC 3986's unreserved set (letters, digits, <samp>-</samp>, <samp>.</samp>, <samp>_</samp>, <samp>~</samp>) are percent-encoded.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2 id="create-item">Create an item</h2>
        <p>Items are created the same way:</p>
        <div class="ldhc-tabs or-horizontal">
            <div class="ldhc-tablist sz-md va-line" role="tablist">
                <button aria-controls="user-interface-2-pane" aria-selected="true" class="ldhc-tab is-on" id="user-interface-2-tab" role="tab" type="button"><span class="ldhc-tab-lbl">User interface</span></button>
                <button aria-controls="command-line-interface-2-pane" aria-selected="false" class="ldhc-tab" id="command-line-interface-2-tab" role="tab" type="button"><span class="ldhc-tab-lbl">Command line interface</span></button>
            </div>
            <div aria-labelledby="user-interface-2-tab" class="ldhc-tabpanel" id="user-interface-2-pane" role="tabpanel">
                    <div>
                        <p>Select <dfn>Item</dfn> from the <span class="btn btn-primary create-action">Create <span class="caret"></span></span> dropdown instead and follow the same steps as above.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <div aria-labelledby="command-line-interface-2-tab" class="ldhc-tabpanel" hidden="hidden" id="command-line-interface-2-pane" role="tabpanel">
                    <div>
                        <p>Execute the following command:</p>
                        <pre>ldh create-item \\
  --container "${LDH_BASE}categories/" \\
  --title "Beverages" \\
  --slug "1"</pre>
                        <p>The command prints the created document's URL — <samp>${LDH_BASE}categories/1/</samp>.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lead"><a href="../../../reference/data-model/documents/" target="_blank">Read more about documents and the document hierarchy.</a></p>
</div>"""^^rdf:XMLLiteral .
